nks to the individual scores within an opus. The new-page attribute, added in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Version 2.0, is used to indicate if the first page of the score is different than the last page of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"previous score. If new-page is “yes”, then a different page is used; if “no”, then the same page is used. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default value is implementation-dependent."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Score"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Score"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlopus\/score"}}}